From 087ef21433184112559ba850c48db2eda56b1725 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Jonas L." <jooola@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:25:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] discovery: remove unused "datacenter" code in hetzner cloud
 discovery (#19269)

* discovery: remove "datacenter" unused code in hetzner cloud discovery

The datacenter property was removed from the server object in the Hetzner Cloud API: https://docs.hetzner.cloud/changelog#2026-07-01-removing-datacenters

This commit reflects the changes made in the API. This should also make upgrading the github.com/hetznercloud/hcloud-go dependency easier.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Lammler <jonas.lammler@hetzner-cloud.de>

* docs: remove note about deprecated label for role hcloud

Signed-off-by: Jonas Lammler <jonas.lammler@hetzner-cloud.de>

* deps: bump github.com/hetznercloud/hcloud-go/v2 to v2.47.0

Signed-off-by: Jonas Lammler <jonas.lammler@hetzner-cloud.de>

---------

Signed-off-by: Jonas Lammler <jonas.lammler@hetzner-cloud.de>
